action is UNKEPT.

Answer with one line per commitment and nothing else:
UNKEPT: <the commitment, quoted verbatim from the reply> | <one sentence: why no record shows anything did it>
KEPT: <the commitment, shortened> | <the call, session, or job that did it>
Or, when the reply holds no commitment at all, exactly: NONE

=== HER REPLY ===
$RESPONSE

